<title>USA: EXTENDED STAY AMERICA NAMES CONTROLLER.</title>
<headline>EXTENDED STAY AMERICA NAMES CONTROLLER.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Extended Stay America Inc said Friday that Patricia Tatham has been named vice president and corporate controller.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Extended Stay, Tatham was the director of general accounting for Viacom Inc's Blockbuster Entertainment Group.</p>
<p>Extended Stay owns a chain of longer-term lodging facilities.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
